   "label": "Default Attendance Mode",
   "options": "Check-in Only\nLive Tracking",
   "default": "Check-in Only",
   "reqd": 1,
   "description": "<b>Check-in Only</b>: employee marks IN and OUT with selfie + location; nothing is recorded in between.<br><b>Live Tracking</b>: same IN/OUT, plus the phone records the route from check-in until check-out (distance, live map, km-based travel claims).<br>Override per employee on the Employee form, <i>Mobile App</i> tab."
  },
